§ `MIRRORBALL on Section A`

§§ `Helpers built from the join's fixtures`

GIVEN driving IS A BOOLEAN
      onv     IS A BOOLEAN
      pass    IS A BOOLEAN
      own     IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A person harmed in the accident`
`a harmed person who is` driving onv pass own MEANS
    `A person harmed in the accident` WITH
        `driving the vehicle` IS driving
        `on the vehicle` IS onv
        `a passenger on the vehicle` IS pass
        `the owner of the vehicle` IS own
        `acted intentionally to cause the damage` IS FALSE
        `died` IS FALSE
        `injuries` IS EMPTY
        `damaged property` IS EMPTY
        `amount agreed with the insured for health and life` IS NOTHING
        `amount fixed by a court decision for health and life` IS NOTHING
        `unidentified, or without a lawful heir` IS FALSE
        `actual necessary costs of burial and of keeping the remains to trace identity` IS 0

GIVEN handed IS A BOOLEAN
      d      IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An accident`
`the standard accident, handed over` handed `on` d MEANS
    `An accident` WITH
        `date of the accident` IS d
        `the vehicle was participating in road traffic` IS TRUE
        `the vehicle was moving, stopped or parked` IS TRUE
        `the vehicle was under the control of its owner or a driver` IS TRUE
        `the owner had handed possession and use of the vehicle to another` IS handed
        `the owner or the driver acted intentionally to cause the damage` IS FALSE
        `the driver who caused it deliberately fled` IS FALSE
        `the driver who fled had performed the owner's civil liability` IS FALSE
        `the driver did not meet the age condition of the Road Traffic Law` IS FALSE
        `the driver had no driving licence` IS FALSE
        `the driver used an invalid driving licence` IS FALSE
        `the driver's licence was erased or altered` IS FALSE
        `the driver's licence had expired at the time of the accident` IS FALSE
        `the driver used a licence not matching the vehicle` IS FALSE
        `the driver's right to use the licence was suspended for a term, or the licence was revoked` IS FALSE
        `the driver's blood or breath alcohol exceeded the normal level in the Ministry of Health guidance` IS FALSE
        `the driver had alcohol in the blood or breath, at any level` IS FALSE
        `the driver had used drugs or banned stimulants` IS FALSE
        `caused by war, terrorism or an earthquake` IS FALSE
        `an authority found it caused entirely by the fault of a third party` IS FALSE
        `several motor vehicles caused it` IS FALSE
        `the owner's share of the fault` IS 1
        `the persons harmed` IS EMPTY

GIVEN cls  IS A `A vehicle class in Annex I`
      paid IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A contract of compulsory motor insurance`
`a 2024 contract for a vehicle of class` cls `with premium paid` paid MEANS
    `A contract of compulsory motor insurance` WITH
        `concluded on` IS YMD 2024 3 1
        `insurance begins on` IS YMD 2024 3 1
        `insurance ends on` IS YMD 2025 3 1
        `the premium paid` IS paid
        `the vehicle` IS `the vehicle of class` cls
        `amended by agreement to apply` IS NOTHING
        `aligned with the owner's first contract of the year` IS FALSE

GIVEN cls IS A `A vehicle class in Annex I`
GIVETH A `A motor vehicle`
`the vehicle of class` cls MEANS
    `A motor vehicle` WITH
        `class in Annex I` IS cls
        `beyond its service life under the law` IS FALSE
        `a foreign vehicle temporarily imported for re-export, in traffic in Vietnam for less than 1 year` IS FALSE
        `remaining service life under the law of less than 1 year` IS FALSE
        `subject to temporary registration` IS FALSE
        `a driving licence is required to drive it` IS TRUE

GIVEN cls IS A `A vehicle class in Annex I`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Annex I premium for one year of` cls MEANS
    CONSIDER `Annex I — the premium for the term of` (`a 2024 contract for a vehicle of class` cls `with premium paid` 0)
    WHEN LEFT problem THEN 0
    WHEN RIGHT n THEN n

§§ `(b1) A03 and A16: every combination of the harmed person's four roles, the owner's hand-over, and the decree vintage`

-- Oracle, Art 3(5)(a) (decree67:84-89): a third party is anyone harmed except the driver, a person on the vehicle, a
-- passenger on it, and the owner, unless the owner has handed possession and use of the vehicle to another.
-- Oracle, Art 5 (decree67:183-186): the insured liability is owed to third parties and to passengers.
-- The contract is the join's 2024 contract; the accident is the join's standard accident, inside the term.
