§§ `(b3) A06: every vehicle class, the premium paid at 0, at 85% less 1 dong, 85%, 100%, 115% and 115% plus 1 dong of Annex I`

-- Oracle, Art 8(2) (decree67:235-238): the insurer may move the Annex I premium by at most 15% either way; outside that
-- band the decree finds a problem. Oracle, Law Dieu 4(28) (law08:182-185): a sum the policyholder pays that the law
-- requires or the parties agree is the premium; the join reads "pays" as "a premium was paid" (assumed, not ruled).
-- The amounts are computed in L4 from VN-10's Annex I figure for the class, so this tests the band, not Annex I.
-- Driving-school vehicles of a type outside sections IV and VI: the decree fixes no premium (Annex I VII.1), so it finds a
-- problem whatever is paid. Oracle, Law Dieu 4(28) (law08:182-185, "theo quy định của pháp luật hoặc do các bên thỏa
-- thuận"): a sum the parties agreed and the buyer paid is still the premium. Until 2026-10-13 the join set VN-29's one
-- flag for "required by law or agreed" from the decree alone and answered FALSE for the 13 amounts paid above 0, which
-- this section pinned as a disagreement classed wrong map; the join's A06 now reads a paid premium as agreed, and agrees.
#ASSERT `the decree finds a problem in` (`the decree's verdict on the premium actually paid under` (`a 2024 contract for a vehicle of class` (`a two-wheeled motorcycle` 150) `with premium paid` (0))) EQUALS TRUE AND `Dieu 4(28): the payment is insurance premium (phi bao hiem)` (`the Law's payment made for the decree's premium under` (`a 2024 contract for a vehicle of class` (`a two-wheeled motorcycle` 150) `with premium paid` (0))) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the decree finds a problem in` (`the decree's verdict on the premium actually paid under` (`a 2024 contract for a vehicle of class` (`a two-wheeled motorcycle` 150) `with premium paid` (((`the Annex I premium for one year of` (`a two-wheeled motorcycle` 150)) TIMES 0.85) MINUS 1))) EQUALS TRUE AND `Dieu 4(28): the payment is insurance premium (phi bao hiem)` (`the Law's payment made for the decree's premium under` (`a 2024 contract for a vehicle of class` (`a two-wheeled motorcycle` 150) `with premium paid` (((`the Annex I premium for one year of` (`a two-wheeled motorcycle` 150)) TIMES 0.85) MINUS 1))) EQUALS TRUE
